---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import FAQPageSchema from '../components/FAQPageSchema.astro';
import LocalBusinessSchema from '../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';

const city = "Clark";
const latitude = 40.6189;
const longitude = -74.3086;

const faqs = [
  { q: "How far is AllStar from Clark?", a: "About 7 minutes via Route 1. 1166 West Chestnut St, Union. Free parking on-site." },
  { q: "What programs are available?", a: "Adult BJJ, Muay Thai, and MMA (ages 16+). Kids Lions (7–13) and Cubs (4–6). Summer camp runs seasonally." },
  { q: "Do I need experience?", a: "No. Most students — adults and kids — start with none." },
  { q: "Can I watch a class before enrolling my child?", a: "Yes. Walk in any time. We don't hide what we do." },
  { q: "What's the free trial?", a: "Two weeks of unlimited classes. Adults can try any program. Kids can try their age group. No card required, no contract, no pressure." },
  { q: "How do I start?", a: "Fill out the form on this page or call (908) 341-1131. We'll text to confirm a class time." },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Martial Arts in Clark, NJ — BJJ, Muay Thai & Kids Classes | AllStar"
  description="Martial arts classes for Clark, NJ families at AllStar Martial Arts in Union. BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs. Renzo Gracie black belt. Free 2-week trial."
  ogImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <LocalBusinessSchema city={city} latitude={latitude} longitude={longitude} />
    <FAQPageSchema faqs={faqs} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="7 minutes from Clark"
    headline="Martial Arts in Clark, NJ"
    sub="Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs — a quick 7-minute run up Route 1 into Union. Free 2-week trial, no contract."
    bgImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
        For a town that spends half its life on Route 1 — the run past Clark Commons, the Parkway on-ramp, the outlet traffic — AllStar is barely a detour. It's about 7 minutes from the middle of Clark up to 1166 West Chestnut in Union, with free parking waiting when you get here. No highway slog, no hunting for a spot. Folks over in <a href="/cranford/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Cranford</a> and <a href="/rahway/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Rahway</a> make the same short hop.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        What actually brings Clark residents in is the coaching. Coach Jamal Patterson is a Renzo Gracie black belt, ADCC veteran, and former professional MMA fighter who competed in the IFL and Bellator. That competition background reshapes how technique gets taught — and the students who've trained here five and ten years will tell you it shows up on the mat.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BJJ -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-gray-light">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">BJJ Classes Near Clark, NJ</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu is our flagship. Adults 16 and up, and beginners are the norm — most people walk in never having tied a belt.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Plenty of schools around Union County teach BJJ, and a few even share our lineage. The difference is who's running the room. Jamal's resume — ADCC, IFL, Bellator, UWC champion — isn't wall decoration; it lives in the details of every position he drills. Read more about <a href="/adult-bjj/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">adult BJJ</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Evening classes run at 6, 7, and 8 PM most weekdays — built for working adults and anyone timing it around the Parkway commute. Two weeks free. No contract.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kids -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Kids Martial Arts</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">Kids Martial Arts Near Clark, NJ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Cubs — Ages 4–6</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Preschool-age energy, channeled. Coordination, listening, and confidence come first, taught in short bursts with constant positive reinforcement so a five-year-old stays locked in the whole class.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-navy">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Lions — Ages 7–13</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Real Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu technique — takedowns, escapes, positions. No karate katas here; these Clark kids are learning a system that actually works, and Clark parents keep telling us the confidence follows them right into the classroom.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mt-5">
        Bully prevention is a genuine part of the curriculum. Once a kid knows they can handle themselves, the whole dynamic with a bully shifts — usually without a single punch. Here's how our <a href="/kids/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">kids program</a> is built.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Muay Thai + MMA -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">Muay Thai</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Muay Thai Near Clark, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            This is the one nobody else in the area pairs with BJJ. No gym in the Clark, Union, or Elizabeth stretch offers authentic Muay Thai instruction under the same roof. Real pad work, real technique, real conditioning — and beginners are genuinely welcome, not thrown to the wolves.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">MMA</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">MMA Classes Near Clark, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Our MMA program stitches BJJ, Muay Thai, and wrestling into one complete system. It's coached by Jamal Patterson — a pro fighter who has cornered UFC athletes from their amateur debut all the way to the big show. Adults 16 and up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Landmarks -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you know Clark</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-5">You Know These Spots — We're 7 Minutes Away</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {["Downtown Clark", "Clark Commons", "Route 1 corridor", "Jersey Shore Premium Outlets", "Clark Police Station", "Clark Library", "Garden State Parkway access", "Oak Ridge Park"].map((l) => (
          <span class="bg-brand-gray-light text-brand-gray px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">📍 {l}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />

  <CTA
    headline="Two Weeks Free — Clark Families Welcome"
    sub="Show up. Bring water. We'll handle the rest. No commitment, no pressure."
  />
</PageLayout>
